  message: "Re-surfaced in dogfooding tranche 10 (U05b, F186.A1 split b, severity 3). Confidence is keyed by (is_resolved, edge.type), not the documented (language, evidence_type) axis — the producer sub-branch driving the split (resolution state) is exposed in no readable axis, matching this item exactly. Fix: reconcile the keying axis — key by the documented axis or re-document the real axis. (related INV-suvil hardcoded-per-emitter.)"  # 507d
